Hard disc installation is not vital, but it will speed up the initial loading
of the game.

Installing to hard disc is very simple......

1. Create a directory on your hard disc where you want the game to go.
   ('RHFT' for example)

2. Select all of the items on the floppy disc by either dragging the select
   box around all the icons, or by selecting them all with the right mouse
   button.

3. Drag the selected icons into your new directory.

